# Never copy host dependencies into an image.
#
# pnpm's node_modules is a tree of symlinks into a content-addressed store that
# exists only on the host. Copying it in overwrites the container's own install
# with links pointing at paths that do not exist there, and the build fails with
# a missing-binary error that points at the compiler rather than at the copy.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Build output — the image builds its own.
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state and secrets
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*-service-account*.json
gcp-key*.json
data/cache
apps/web/public/data

# Editor / OS
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs and CI are not build inputs
docs
*.md
!README.md
.github
